From {{inh|fo|non|eptir}}, {{m|non|eptr}}, from {{inh|fo|gmq-pro|ᚨᚠᛏᛖᚱ}}, from {{inh|fo|gem-pro|*aftiri||more aft, further behind}}, {{m|gem-pro|*after}}, from {{inh|fo|ine-pro|*h₂epóteros||further behind, further away}}, comparative form of {{m|ine-pro|*h₂epó||off, behind}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|fo|/ˈɛʰtːɪɹ/}}
* {{rhymes|fo|ɛʰtːɪɹ}}

===Preposition===
{{fo-prep}}

# [[after]]

